<title>USA: Xpedite Systems Q4 net falls.</title>
<headline>Xpedite Systems Q4 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>XPEDITE SYSTEMS, INC.</p>
<p>		   CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF OPERATIONS</p>
<p>			    Three months ended  Twelve months ended</p>
<p>				Dec 31,  Dec 31,	Dec 31, Dec 31,</p>
<p>				   1996  1995(a)	   1996 1995(a)</p>
<p> Total net revenue	  35,080  19,700	129,848  55,684</p>
<p> Net income		    2,762   1,778	 10,433   6,436</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding		  9,316   7,395	  8,716   6,982</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>  of common stock	     0.30    0.24	   1.20    0.92</p>
<p> EBITDA			  7,609   3,832	 29,145  12,030</p>
<p>EBITDA per share of</p>
<p>  common stock		  0.82    0.52	   3.34    1.72</p>
<p>NOTE - (a) Excludes a $53.0 million write-off of in-process research and development costs in connection with the acquisitions of ViTel, Swift and Comwave in November 1995.</p>
</text>
